{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\n椎名ぴかりんさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔界行ってみたい！！\n来てくださってありがとうございました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のテーマは おしおき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったんだけど\nダンボイさんのお話になってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うむ、気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n今日、使える話題もありましたね！\n期待してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信なかったらやらなくて全然いいよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といえことで\n今週も聴いてくださって\nありがとうございました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/04/29/2497390/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は個別です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/04/29/2497390/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近撮った写真は何の写真？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/04/29/2497390/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田におぬぬめしたい便利グッズとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\nここ最近握手会ありすぎてネタがないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また後ほど～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":